---
profile: production

# Cross-role variables are intentional in this collection.
# The compliance, compliance_*, stig_controls, stig_results, and stig_rules
# variables are the collection's public API that flows between
# roles (scan -> evaluate -> remediate -> report).
# See docs/adr/0002-conventions-and-data-model.md for rationale.
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
